proposals.content:
[Brook](https://twitter.com/0x1092) has been documenting Lil Nouns events so it becomes easier to find, understand, and stay updated. He’d like to continue this work. In this proposal, you'll find a breakdown of what he has been working on, followed by future work.

**CURRENT WORK**

- recording discord community calls;
- writing TL;DRs for meetings;
- sharing call summaries on discord;
- creating a repository of call summaries.

**FUTURE WORK**

- maintaining repository of call summaries;
- writing discord summaries;
- weekly updates on overall DAO status;
- an interlinked web of notes to get a better understanding of Lil Nouns ecosystem;
- opt-in for a weekly Twitter Notification for summaries;

**REPOSITORIES**

- [Notion](https://www.notion.so/al409/ace58561bb1c4f30a963548ae4b2638b?v=d15ff86ed3ab417994d420d88c2d46b3)
- [Markdown](https://hackmd.io/@broook?tags=%5B%22community+call%22%5D)
- *Focus will be more on Markdown*

**FUNDING**

1 Ξ - Retroactive funding

1 Ξ - 1 Month Runway

